<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb M2 falls 0.7 pct yr/yr -Central Bank.</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb M2 falls 0.7 pct yr/yr -Central Bank.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's M2 money aggregate fell 0.7 percent year-on-year in February after a 0.4 percent rise in January, the Bank of Finland said on Friday  SPFG.  </p>
<p>	     Feb 1997    Change	    Jan 1996     Change</p>
<p>	     (bln mk)  Yr/Yr (pct)	 (bln mk)   Yr/Yr (pct)</p>
<p> M1	   200.2	+12.2		205.2	 +16.8</p>
<p> M2	   293.0	 -0.7		297.8	  +0.4</p>
<p> M3	   324.5	 -0.7		329.3	  -0.7</p>
</text>
